# {{.Label}} review rules

These rules were mined from {{.Stats.PRsWithDiscussion}} {{.Label}} pull requests with review discussion. Each rule is backed by real review comments and graded by how consistently the team applies it:

- **Golden**: firm team rules. Always follow them.
- **Conditional**: follow them when the stated condition holds.
- **Hints**: weaker or contested signals. Weigh them; don't enforce them.

When writing code, apply the rules whose scope matches the files you touch. When reviewing, cite the rule ID. The quoted review comments behind every rule are in [reference/evidence.md](reference/evidence.md); read it when you need to justify a rule or judge how strictly it is applied.
